@guide H_33_SwampofSorrows
@name Swamp of Sorrows (41-42)
@faction Horde
@levels 41-42
@zone Swamp of Sorrows
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Swamp of Sorrows, visit 1 of 2 on the Horde route, levels 41-42.
@next H_34_StranglethornVale

travel Swamp of Sorrows
note From Grom'gol ride north through Duskwood (Alliance zone: keep off the roads) and east through Deadwind Pass into the Swamp of Sorrows.
accept 1389 Draenethyst Crystals | Magtoor, a Lost One in the hut at the west end of the swamp. He is friendly.
fp Stonard
accept 1424 Pool of Tears | Fel'zerul, Stonard.
turnin 1420 Report to Helgrum
note The next quest, Galen's Escape, is an escort: pick it up only when you are ready to follow the NPC.
accept 1393 Galen's Escape
complete 1393 Galen's Escape | Escort: stay close; it fails if the NPC dies.
accept 698 Lack of Surplus | Dar, just outside Stonard.
accept 1430 Fresh Meat | Dar.
complete 698 Lack of Surplus | Unprepared Sawtooth Flanks from Sawtooth Crocolisks around the lakes east of Stonard.
complete 1389 Draenethyst Crystals | Draenethyst Crystals on the ground in the same north-east area.
complete 1424 Pool of Tears | Atal'ai Artifacts on the ground around the Pool of Tears, east of Stonard.
turnin 698 Lack of Surplus | Tok'Kar at the Misty Reed Strand, south-east coast.
accept 699 Lack of Surplus
complete 699 Lack of Surplus | Sawtooth Snapper Claws from Sawtooth Snappers on the east coast, north of Tok'Kar.
complete 1430 Fresh Meat | Monstrous Crawler Legs from Monstrous Crawlers on the same east coast.
turnin 699 Lack of Surplus | Tok'Kar.
turnin 1424 Pool of Tears | Fel'zerul.
turnin 1393 Galen's Escape
turnin 1430 Fresh Meat | Dar.
turnin 1389 Draenethyst Crystals | Magtoor, at the west end of the swamp.
level 42 | Stranglethorn Vale starts at 42. If you are lower, kill what is around you here (or run a dungeon) until you reach it.
